dies successfully. 金額 Amount 1000 美元 等值之新台幣(依本校換算成台幣後之實際金額給付) 1,000 USD equivalent in NTD(the actual amount paid based on the exchange rate at the disbursement). 名額 Quota 3名(最終依南加州校友會審核決議而定) 3 (Final determination is subject to the review and approval of the Southern California Alumni Association). 申請 資格 Eligibility 1.本校大學部二年級至四年級學生。 Undergraduate students in their second to fourth year. 2.成績優良，具有原創性研發潛力者及經濟上需協助者。 Students with excellent academic performance, original research potential, or financial need. 申請 方式 Application Method 備齊所需文件至本校生輔組(惠蓀堂2樓)申請 Submit the required documents to the Student Life Division at our university (2nd Floor, Hui-Sun Auditorium). 申請 必備 文件 Required Documents 一、獎學金申請書及最近半身相片1張。 Scholarship application form and one recent half-length photo. 二、歷年成績單。 Academic transcripts from all years of study. 三、自傳及生涯規劃。 Autobiography and career plan. 四、推薦信二封。 Two letters of recommendation. 五、符合下列資格之一者，可申請。 低收入戶證明。 學生本人及父母所得+戶籍資料。 家中收入因故銳減證明。 Proof of financial need (choose one of the following): Low-income household certificate Income and household registration documents of the student and parents Proof of a significant reduction in family income 六、非必備：其他有助於審查文件(例如：任何創作–報章期刊有刊登的) Optional: Any additional documents that may support the review process (e.g., published creative works in newspapers or journals). 收件截止日：6 月 10 日 至 8月 14 日 17 時止 (郵寄者，以郵戳為憑) A pplication Period: 06/10 ~ 08/14 (until 17:00). Applications submitted by mail will be considered based on the postmark date. 洽詢方式：04-22871084 蕭小姐 Contact: 04-22871084, Ms.Hsiao 備註 Notes ◎本獎學金由南加州校友會獎學金委員會審查，獎學金將於校慶前匯入獲獎者帳戶， 並於每年校慶時由回校參加校慶的理事或委員進行公開表揚。 The Southern California Alumni Association Scholarship Committee is responsible for the review process. The scholarship will be transferred to the recipients’ accounts before the university anniversary and publicly awarded by attending directors or committee members during the celebration. ◎轉學生用前學校成績單申請。 Transfer students may apply using their transcripts from their previous institution. 資料 取得 方式 Document Acquisition ◎成績證明：大學部與研究所→ 向註冊組申請、進修部→ 向進修教育組申請。 ◎ Academic transcripts: Undergraduate & graduate students → Apply at the Registration Division. Continuing education students → Apply at the Division of Continuing Education. (1) 南加州獎學金辦法-EN.pdf (2) 南加州校友會獎學金申請表-EN.pdf (3) 南加州校友會獎學金申請書1140714.pdf 網站指引 中興大學首頁 聯絡資訊 網站導覽 ENGLISH 站內搜尋 組室/中心 學生安全輔導室 生活輔導組 課外活動組 生涯發展中心 住宿輔導組 健康及諮商中心 原住民族學生資源中心 聯絡我們 國立中興大學 學生事務處 生活輔導組 地址： 402 台中市南區興大路145號 惠蓀堂二樓 電話： 04-22871084 Email： living@nchu.edu.tw Copyright © Office of Student Affairs, NCHU 網站系統後台 智慧財產權聲明 隱私權聲明 TOP"
